@startuml
!include ../_style.iuml
title Контрприклад TLC: Mutant\n<size:14>згенеровано автоматично з контрприкладу TLC</size>

participant "Координатор" as TM
queue "Мережа" as NET
participant "payment" as RM_payment
participant "inventory" as RM_inventory
participant "order" as RM_order

note over TM, RM_order: <b>1.</b> Старт: усі сервіси у стані working
note over RM_payment: <b>2.</b> записав PREPARED у журнал
RM_payment -> NET: Prepared (так)
NET -> TM: <b>3.</b> Prepared від payment
note over TM #C8E6C9: <b>4.</b> рішення COMMIT записано в журнал
TM -> NET: Commit (усім)
NET -> RM_payment: <b>5.</b> Commit
note over RM_payment #C8E6C9: committed
note over RM_inventory #FFE0B2: <b>6.</b> голос «ні» → aborted

note across #FFF9C4
<b>Порушено: Consistency</b>
payment = committed
inventory = aborted
order = working
координатор = committed
end note
@enduml
